## 📊 Essential Testing Pyramid

```
           /\
          /  \          ← E2E Tests (Playwright) - MINIMAL
         /    \           5% of tests (CRITICAL FLOWS ONLY)
        /------\          Only for real user journeys
       /        \
      /  E2E     \
     /    REAL   \
    /   Services  \     ← Integration Tests (Jest + RTL)
   /----------------\     25% of tests (USER INTERACTIONS)
  /   Integration   \    Fast, reliable, essential only
 /--------------------\
/                      \  ← Unit Tests (Jest) - MAXIMUM
/    Unit Tests         \   70% of tests (PURE FUNCTIONS)
/    Pure Logic Only    \   Fast, reliable, focused
/________________________\  NO EXTERNAL DEPENDENCIES
```

### Test Distribution (Essential Only)
- **70% Unit Tests** - Pure functions, utilities, business logic
- **25% Integration Tests** - User interactions, form validation, navigation  
- **5% E2E Tests** - Critical user flows only

