## 🔥 Testing with Real External Services

### ✅ Use Playwright with REAL Services

**Firebase/Firestore**:
- Use real Firebase test environment
- Test actual data persistence
- Verify encryption/decryption works end-to-end

**AWS Cognito**:
- Use real Cognito test user pool
- Create dedicated test users
- Don't delete test users (reuse them)

**Chrome Storage**:
- Test real Chrome Storage persistence
- Verify data survives popup close/reopen

### ❌ Never Mock External Services in E2E

Mocking Firebase, Cognito, or Chrome APIs in E2E tests defeats the purpose. If you need mocks, use Jest instead.

